<title>CHINA: Oriental Metals shares suspended.</title>
<headline>Oriental Metals shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in shares of Oriental Metals (Holdings) Co Ltd was suspended on Tuesday at the request of the company pending an announcement, the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong said.  </p>
<p>The stock last traded at HK$2.125.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6345</p>
